name: 塔斯汀微信小程序
desc: "- 启动页｜弹窗\n- 首页｜顶部Banner\n- 首页｜塔塔热推\n- 首页｜弹窗\n- 订单页｜弹窗\n- 支付页｜超值换购弹窗\n- 点单页｜商品列表横幅 banner\n- 点单页｜菜单上方活动提示    "
category: ad
icon: https://www.tasiting.com/templates/tastien/image/29440_16868769529842.ico
http:
    mitm:
        - sss-web.tastientech.com
    force-http-engine:
        - sss-web.tastientech.com
    url-rewrite:
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/accumulationPointWX/queryActivityTips - reject
    body-rewrite:
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("INDEX_TOP_BANNER")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("INDEX_HOT_AREA")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("PRODUCT_LIST_LEFTMENU_BANNER")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("ORDER_DETAIL_BANNER")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("J_TSDD")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("J_INDEX")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("GROUP_COUPON_BANNER")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("HOME_BOTTOM_ENTRY")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("INDEX_WAIST_AREA")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/list response-jq if .result != null then .result|=map(select(.locationCode|index("HOME_PAGE_BOTTOM_FLOATING_ICON")|not)) end
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/minic/shop/intelligence/banner/c/firstBanner response-jq .result={}
        - https://sss-web.tastientech.com/api/activity/productDiscountRecommend/recommend response-jq .result.popupFlag=false
